; An interpolated -10.00 HOOL opens a short lot beside the 10 HOOL held at
; the same cost. STRICT_WITH_SIZE cannot choose between the two by cost and
; takes the lot of the reduction's size; like beancount, it books the lot's
; own units, so the reduction is 10.00 HOOL.
option "inferred_tolerance_default" "*:0.01"

2020-01-01 open Assets:Size "STRICT_WITH_SIZE"
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 *
  Assets:Size  10 HOOL {10 USD}

2020-02-01 *
  Assets:Cash  100 USD
  Assets:Size  HOOL {10 USD}

2020-03-03 *
  Assets:Size  10 HOOL {10 USD}
